OL,3,ABabydoll singer becomes first Welsh
OL,4,Aartist to top UK singles chart in 15
OL,5,Ayears
OL,6,
OL,7,FJamie Miller has become the first Welsh
OL,8,Fartist to top the UK singles chart in
OL,9,F15 years with his viral TikTok hit,
OL,10,FBabydoll.
OL,12,FMiller, who is originally from
OL,13,FPontprennau in Cardiff, narrowly beat
OL,14,FTate McRae and her single Housewife to
OL,15,Fclaim the top spot on the UK Number 1
OL,16,Fon Friday, according to the Official
OL,17,FCharts Company.
OL,19,FThe achievement means Miller is the
OL,20,Ffirst Welsh artist since 2011 to earn a
OL,21,FUK Number 1 single - after Sian Evans'
OL,22,Ffeature on DJ Fresh's Louder.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
