OL,3,ABabydoll singer becomes first Welsh
OL,4,Aartist to top UK singles chart in 15
OL,5,Ayears
OL,6,
OL,7,FMiller, 29, told Charts: "I don't even
OL,8,Fknow what to say other than thank you
OL,9,Fso much for getting me Number 1, this
OL,10,Fis the biggest thing that's ever
OL,11,Fhappened to me in my life, I love you
OL,12,Fguys."
